      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَفْطَافٌ</span></b>  The <i>extremities of trees:</i> (S, O, K:)
or the <i>soft,</i> or <i>tender, and succulent,</i> of plants, or
herbage: or, accord. to El-Mufaddal, the <i>leaves
of the branches.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَفٌّ</span>.

